  "title": "extcap: simplify handling of the sub-options result + only update on accept",
  "description": "- when using extcap sub-options (options inside a extcap table), we can simplify the retrieval of the results by storing them inside the dialog, instead of iterating once more over the device list.\n- only update the sub-options when the UI is accepted, not finished.\n- this also removes a `global_capture_opts` usage.",
